## SVG Mechanism: OAuth 2.0 PKCE Handshake

This standalone HTML document renders a responsive, token-synced 2D animated sequence diagram of the OAuth 2.0 PKCE handshake across **Browser App**, **Auth Server**, and **Token Endpoint** (`viewBox="0 0 880 480"`). Because no local `design/tokens.css` file was present in the workspace, it embeds self-contained semantic `--color-*` tokens (compatible with `design/tokens.css`) and `--mech-*` aliases supporting light mode, dark mode (`[data-theme="dark"]` and `prefers-color-scheme: dark`), interactive Play/Pause, keyboard stage inspection, and `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`.

### Stages & Token Map

- **Actors:**
  - **Browser App** (`PKCE Client`) — initiates Stage 1, receives Stage 2, initiates and completes Stage 3.
  - **Auth Server** (`Authorization`) — receives Stage 1 and returns Stage 2.
  - **Token Endpoint** (`Verifier Check`) — receives Stage 3 (`Code + Verifier`) and returns Stage 3 (`Access Token`).
- **Stages:**
  - **Stage 1:** `Auth Request + Code Challenge` (`Browser App` → `Auth Server`) — primary accent stream (`--mech-accent`).
  - **Stage 2:** `Auth Code` (`Auth Server` → `Browser App`) — warning/amber accent stream (`--mech-warn`).
  - **Stage 3:** `Code + Verifier -> Access Token` (`Browser App` → `Token Endpoint` → `Browser App`) — primary request stream (`--mech-accent`) and success return stream (`--mech-ok`).
- **CSS Custom Properties (bound to all SVG fills, strokes, and gradient stops):**
  - Surfaces & grid: `--mech-canvas` (`--color-surface-default`), `--mech-node-top` (`--color-surface-raised`), `--mech-node-bottom` (`--color-surface-subtle`), `--mech-grid-dot` (`--color-border-default`).
  - Borders & tracks: `--mech-border` (`--color-border-strong`), `--mech-track` (`--color-border-strong`), `--mech-focus` (`--color-border-focus`).
  - Semantic signals & badges: `--mech-accent` (`--color-action-primary-bg`), `--mech-badge-ink` (`--color-action-primary-text`), `--mech-warn` (`--color-warning-text`), `--mech-ok` (`--color-success-text`).
  - Typography: `--mech-text` (`--color-text-default`), `--mech-muted` (`--color-text-muted`).

